# Dreierschnapsen Project Rules

## Architecture
- Workspace has 3 crates: `schnapsen-model`, `schnapsen-engine`, `schnapsen-cli`
- `schnapsen-model` is the foundation: pure data structures, no game logic
- `schnapsen-engine` depends on model: validation, state transitions, AI
- `schnapsen-cli` depends on both: ratatui TUI, no game logic here

## Domain Terminology (German → Code)
- Farbe → `Suit`, Herz/Karo/Pik/Kreuz → `Hearts/Diamonds/Spades/Clubs`
- Ass/Zehner/König/Ober/Unter → `Ace/Ten/King/Queen/Jack`
- Rufer → `Caller`, Geber → `Dealer`
- Trumpf → `trump`, Stich → `Trick`, Talon → `talon`
- Zwanziger/Vierziger → `Marriage`/`RoyalMarriage` (20/40 points)
- Spritzen → `Double`, Zurückgespritzt → `Redouble`

## Card Values
- Ace=11, Ten=10, King=4, Queen=3, Jack=2 (total 120 in deck)

## Testing
- Unit tests in each module file via `#[cfg(test)]`
- Use descriptive test names reflecting game scenarios
